Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.29,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡ENFRENTE DE LA\NPOLICÍA!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Oh, me ha gustado este\Ncarro, es buenísimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.35,0:00:05.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me lo voy a comprar en la\Nvida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cómo que me han\Nreportado?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a perder a la policía\Nprimero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Eso es parte de la\Nmisión?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:16.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No atropellé a nadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Cuidado, hombre!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Enfrente de la policía he\Nhecho esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:24.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Puta madre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:27.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, no es mi culpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Iba muy despacio el de la\Nbici.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué? ¿Me han reportado\Notra vez?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:35.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué he hecho esta vez?
